background:
  color: $paper
  type: solid
pageType: content
notes: 阶段五：比价分析，物料对齐两遍法
elements:
  - bounds: [64, 38, 400, 16]
    content:
      style: $kicker
      text: PART 02 · PIPELINE
      wrap: false
    elementId: kicker
    elementType: text
  - bounds: [64, 60, 832, 40]
    content:
      style: $title
      text: 阶段 5：比价分析，最难的是"这是不是同一个东西"
      wrap: false
    elementId: title
    elementType: text
  - bounds: [64, 108, 832, 1]
    elementId: rule
    elementType: shape
    fill: {color: $line, type: solid}
    shapeName: rect
  - bounds: [64, 132, 832, 24]
    content:
      style: $body
      align: [left, middle]
      text: |
        <p>同一物料在不同报价单里写法不同：<span style="font-family:JetBrains Mono">"内六角螺钉 M8×20"</span> vs <span style="font-family:JetBrains Mono">"M8*20 内六角螺丝"</span></p>
      wrap: false
    elementId: problem
    elementType: text
  - bounds: [64, 172, 200, 18]
    content:
      style: $kicker
      fontSize: 10
      text: 第一遍 · 规则归一化
      wrap: false
    elementId: label-p1
    elementType: text
  - bounds: [64, 196, 396, 110]
    elementId: box-p1
    elementType: shape
    fill: {color: $beige, type: solid}
    shapeName: rect
  - bounds: [80, 208, 364, 90]
    content:
      style: $body
      fontSize: 12
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>去空格、×/* 统一、转小写、全半角统一，</p>
        <p>然后按 <strong>"名称 + 规格"精确匹配</strong>分组。</p>
        <p style="margin-top:6px"><span style="color:$gray">能规则解决的，绝不动用 LLM。</span></p>
    elementId: box-p1-t
    elementType: text
  - bounds: [500, 172, 200, 18]
    content:
      style: $kicker
      fontSize: 10
      text: 第二遍 · LLM 兜底
      wrap: false
    elementId: label-p2
    elementType: text
  - bounds: [500, 196, 396, 110]
    border: {color: $green, style: solid, width: 1}
    elementId: box-p2
    elementType: shape
    shapeName: rect
  - bounds: [516, 208, 364, 90]
    content:
      style: $body
      fontSize: 12
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>对未匹配的孤立行，把候选清单给 LLM 判定</p>
        <p><strong>"是否为同一物料"</strong>，每对输出置信度。</p>
        <p style="margin-top:6px"><span style="color:$gray">置信度 low 的一律不合并，相邻放置并标黄。</span></p>
    elementId: box-p2-t
    elementType: text
  - bounds: [64, 326, 200, 18]
    content:
      style: $kicker
      fontSize: 10
      text: 对齐之后 · 每组计算
      wrap: false
    elementId: label-calc
    elementType: text
  - bounds: [64, 352, 832, 64]
    content:
      style: $body
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>· 每个物料组：报价家数、最低 / 最高价、<strong>均价</strong>、各家<strong>偏离均价百分比</strong>、最短 / 最长交期</p>
        <p style="margin-top:6px">· 缺报检测：某物料有 ≥2 家报价但某供应商未报 → 该供应商该物料标记<span style="color:$orange"><strong>缺报</strong></span></p>
    elementId: calc-body
    elementType: text
  - bounds: [64, 434, 832, 22]
    content:
      fontFamily: MiSans, MiSans
      fontSize: 14
      color: $ink
      align: [left, middle]
      text: |
        <p>保守原则：<span style="color:$orange"><strong>宁可不合并标黄提示人工，也不可错误合并。</strong></span></p>
      wrap: false
    elementId: bottom-line
    elementType: text
  - bounds: [64, 478, 560, 16]
    content:
      style: $small
      text: 技术分享 · 报价单提取比价工具
      wrap: false
    elementId: footer
    elementType: text
  - bounds: [860, 478, 36, 16]
    content:
      style: $mono
      fontSize: 12
      align: [right, top]
      text: '12'
      wrap: false
    elementId: page-num
    elementType: text
